  "albumInformation": "<p>Two contemporary pieces for string quartet composed by <a href=\"https://musopen.org/composer/maciej-zonowski/\">Maciej Żołnowski</a> and housed at <a href=\"https://musopen.org/composer/maciej-zonowski/\">MusOpen</a> who write:</p>\n<p>'Kwartet Japoński I' is the title of a short piece for string quartet composed by Maciej Zolnowski. Marked 'largo' in the score, a standard performance of the piece takes 1 minute.</p>\n<p>'Kwartet Japoński II' is the title of a short piece for string quartet by Maciej Zolnowski. The piece lasts around 2 minutes and demands some extended technique from the players.</p>\n<p><em>cover art improvised with photograph by <a href=\"http://www.publicdomainpictures.net/browse-author.php?a=31330\">Mya Told</a> titled \"Mount Fuji\"</em></p>",
